Package: HetCalibrate
Type: Package
Title: Calibration of Inexact Computer Models with Heteroscedastic Errors
Version: 0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chih-Li", "Sung", email = "iamdfchile@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mickael", "Binois", role = "ctb", comment = "hetGP routines"),
    person("Robert B.", "Gramacy", role = "ctb", comment = "hetGP routines"))
Description:
    Estimates calibration parameters of inexact computer models using
    replicated observations with input-dependent measurement variances.
    Gaussian process models describe model discrepancy and heteroscedastic
    errors, with an optional orthogonal discrepancy process. Implements
    the method of Sung, Barber, and Walker (2022) <doi:10.1137/21M1417946>.
License: GPL-2 | GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
